00:00:03.700 --> 00:00:06.260
Lady Gaga's dogs were apparently kidnapped

00:00:06.260 --> 00:00:07.970
or I guess dog napped

00:00:07.970 --> 00:00:10.140
and people are wondering
what were the actual crimes

00:00:10.140 --> 00:00:10.973
that were committed here?

00:00:10.973 --> 00:00:12.010
Well, there were a bunch

00:00:12.010 --> 00:00:13.680
and as much as we love dogs

00:00:13.680 --> 00:00:14.690
and they are a part of the family,

00:00:14.690 --> 00:00:16.230
they are also considered property.

00:00:16.230 --> 00:00:18.900
So it is theft, it's conversion to try

00:00:18.900 --> 00:00:20.120
