00:00:20.120 --> 00:00:21.250
Many states, including California

00:00:21.250 --> 00:00:24.210
have specific laws about
trying to take someone's dog.

00:00:24.210 --> 00:00:26.390
But, on top of about these
robbers actually used a gun

00:00:26.390 --> 00:00:30.120
and shot the dog walker, who
was walking Lady Gaga's dog.

00:00:30.120 --> 00:00:31.580
Now that is aggravated robbery,

00:00:31.580 --> 00:00:34.205
when you use a deadly
weapon to commit a robbery,

00:00:34.205 --> 00:00:36.020
that is what makes it aggravated.

00:00:36.020 --> 00:00:37.670
So that's clearly a crime there,

00:00:37.670 --> 00:00:38.970
